* @title Dynamic definition and evaluation
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Chapter 3
* @match substring
* @expect >>>
* 42
* 10
* 10
* <<<
          OPSYN('ADD', '+', 2)
          OUTPUT = ADD(20, 22)
          OUTPUT = EVAL('5 * 2')
          DEFINE('DOUBLE(X)') :(SKIP)
DOUBLE    DOUBLE = X * 2 :(RETURN)
SKIP      OUTPUT = APPLY('DOUBLE', 5)
          :(END)
END